  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SPLASH Vatten o sanitet forskning SPLASH 2011-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Sanitation Services Research SPLASH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A transnational call for research on Sustainable Sanitation Services  Chains by SPLASH ERA-net, one of the EU Water Initiative Research     Area Networks. SPLASH is a consotium of 16 ministries, funging        agencies and national research &amp; technology development bodies from   11 countries. The call focuses on regulatory frame works, markets and governance of sanitation systems in developing countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En international utlysning f&#xf6;r forskning om Sustainable Sanitation    Services Chains av SPLASH ERA-net, ett n&#xe4;tverk under EUs Water        Initiatve Research Area Networks. SPLASH &#xe4;r ett konsoritum av 16      ministerier, finansi&#xe4;rer samt nationella organ f&#xf6;r utveckling av      forskning och teknologi. Utlysningen fokuserar p&#xe5; regelverk,          marknader och governance av sanit&#xe4;ra system i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
  </description>
